Super Bright USB Rechargeable Plastic Flashlight with Side Light – Compact, Durable &amp; Powerful LED Torch
&nbsp;
Description
The Super Bright USB Rechargeable Flashlight combines powerful illumination with convenient portability. Featuring an ultra-bright front LED beam and an integrated side COB light, it’s perfect for close-up tasks, camping, travel, and emergency situations. Crafted from durable plastic for lightweight strength, it offers reliable performance in a compact design. Powered by USB rechargeable technology, this flashlight is eco-friendly, cost-effective, and always ready when you need it—making it an essential tool for your home, car, or outdoor adventures.

Size: 12 cm

&nbsp;

&nbsp;
 Key Features:

 	Ultra-Bright Illumination – Powerful LED front light for long-distance visibility.
 	Dual Light Mode – Front LED beam and side COB light for versatile use.
 	USB Rechargeable – Eco-friendly and cost-effective charging via USB.
 	Lightweight &amp; Durable – Made from sturdy plastic for easy portability.
 	Multi-Purpose Use – Ideal for camping, travel, emergencies, or everyday tasks.
 	Compact Design – Easy to carry in pockets, bags, or emergency kits.

   

